@startuml
title UML state - ATM authorization lifecycle with bounded financial effects (WP-35)
[*] --> PENDING : AUTHORIZATION (row keyed by network message id)
PENDING --> APPROVED : Core hold (operation = authorization id)
PENDING --> DECLINED : limit / restricted / insufficient funds
APPROVED --> COMPLETED : COMPLETION -> core.atm_withdrawal\n(UNIQUE operation+kind: posts once)
APPROVED --> REVERSED : REVERSAL -> hold released
APPROVED --> EXPIRED : network timeout (120 s) -> worker releases hold
COMPLETED --> COMPLETED : late REVERSAL -> flagged for review\n(never auto-posted; reconciliation item)
DECLINED --> [*]
REVERSED --> [*]
EXPIRED --> [*]
note right of PENDING
  duplicate message id -> stored signed response
  same id, different content -> 409
  unsupported operation -> DECLINED, no row effect
end note
@enduml
